OL,3,GNEWSADropped YouTubers plan rival city
OL,4,Alights switch-on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular podcaster who was dropped
OL,7,Ffrom a city's Christmas lights
OL,8,Fswitch-on said he was planning to hold
OL,9,Fan "alternative" event on the same
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,12,FJack Dean, known as JaackMaate, was
OL,13,Fscheduled to appear outside Norwich
OL,14,FCity Hall on Thursday, 19 November but
OL,15,Fthe city council withdrew the invite
OL,16,Fafter it reviewed his past "published
OL,17,Fcontent".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
