OL,3,GNEWSADropped YouTubers plan rival city
OL,4,Alights switch-on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old, who comes from the
OL,7,Fcity and has more than a million
OL,8,Fsubscribers, said he was left "pretty
OL,9,Fgutted, disappointed and upset" by the
OL,10,Fdecision.
OL,12,FBut his Happy Hour co-host Robbie Knox
OL,13,Fsaid it "doesn't mean we can't switch
OL,14,Fon other lights".
